# Pairs with TypeOK. A run starts into a phase the process does not have.
MODULE: TypeOkStartInvalidPhase
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a run starts in an undeclared phase
PERTURBS: Start

--- FIND
    /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![p] = "enum"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an undeclared phase.
    /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![p] = "sweeping"]
--- END
